  "page.conn.p.each-person-has-four-totem-animals": "Each person has four totem animals — Spirit, Mind, Heart, and Body. We compare the same pillar between two people and score five connection modes.",
  "page.conn.h3.rainbow": "Rainbow",
  "page.conn.p.yin-and-yang-companions-each-one": "Yin and Yang companions — each one brings out the other animal's true colors like a prism, hence the term \"Rainbow.\" A rare pairing worth cherishing whenever you come across it.",
